ated": 1795650000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "素材分支：复用文字、截图、录屏或已有音频。导入音频需准确字幕时间；声音设计可能跨句变音色，先检查多句试\n听。", "originalText": "素材分支：复用文字、截图、录屏或已有音频。导入音频需准确字幕时间；声音设计可能跨句变音色，先检查多句试听。", "fontSize": 25, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "sequence-b-36", "type": "arrow", "x": 910, "y": 1289, "width": 380, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#315de8", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 36, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 36, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795650000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[380, 0], [0, 0]], "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "sequence-b-37", "type": "text", "x": 934, "y": 1194, "width": 332, "height": 72.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#17243a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 37, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 37, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795650000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "需要网页素材时：先测配\n音，再安排真实动作", "originalText": "需要网页素材时：先测配音，再安排真实动作", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "sequence-b-38", "type": "arrow", "x": 910, "y": 1407, "width": 380, "height": 0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#16786f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 38, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 38, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1795650000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0], [38